sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant Browser as Browser interface
    participant Controller as ChatController
    participant History as ChatHistoryService
    participant DB as MySQL via JPA
    participant Chat as ChatService
    participant Gemini as Gemini API

    Student->>Browser: Enter message and submit
    Browser->>Controller: POST chat request with session and CSRF
    Controller->>History: Submit student, conversation, request ID, message
    History->>DB: Find or create owned conversation
    History->>DB: Load recent completed turns
    History->>DB: Save pending student message
    History->>Chat: Generate answer with recent chat history
    Chat->>Gemini: POST generateContent request
    alt Gemini returns answer
        Gemini-->>Chat: Generated answer
        Chat-->>History: Answer text
        History->>DB: Save assistant message and complete student message
        History-->>Controller: Answer and conversation identifiers
        Controller-->>Browser: HTTP success with answer
        Browser-->>Student: Display assistant response
    else Gemini call fails
        Gemini-->>Chat: Provider error or connection failure
        Chat-->>History: Service error
        History->>DB: Mark student message failed
        History-->>Controller: Error result and status
        Controller-->>Browser: HTTP error with failure message
        Browser-->>Student: Display failure message
    end
